' Question: what does a bot ask of other modules, and what does it hear back?
' Explained by: ../03-context.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
' Solid arrows are calls through a port; dashed arrows are events on the bus.
@startuml 03-context-out
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[bots] as B
[trading] as T
[market_data] as M
B --> T : IVenueTradingPorts\norders, owner budget, account
B --> M : IMarketStream, candle sync
T ..> B : fills, ends, rejections, funding,\nposition divergence, trading switch,\nuser-stream health
M ..> B : MarketTickEvent
note bottom of T : the only module that sends orders
@enduml
